# The base shapes again, drawn UNLIT: a piece of this container shows its plain colour whatever the light, so in
# the dark it reads as a glow. The units' eyes (Debug/CubeGuy.pre) are its spheres. No ray tracing: an eye casts
# no shadow.
ObjectContainer eyes
	Path "Models/baseshapes.glb"
	MaterialOverrides
		PipelineIdx UnlitOpaque
		ExcludeFromRayTracing true
